Note: Tuple destructuring assignment (TUP-09)
Note: Tests: <<Type? name, ...>> = expr binds each component

use "@std"

Note: ===== Test 1: typed slots =====
Tuple<<Int, Int>> pair = <<10, 20>>
<<Int a, Int b>> = pair
(print (str a))
(print (str b))

Note: ===== Test 2: bare names =====
<<x, y>> = <<100, 200>>
(print (str x))
(print (str y))

Note: ===== Test 3: Note + Note slots =====
Note: Plan named example Note+Beat but Beat has no direct literal in 26.1 — use Note+Note.
Tuple<<Note, Note>> entry = <<C4, D4>>
<<Note pitch, Note other>> = entry
(print (str pitch))
(print (str other))

(print "test_tuple_destructure: PASSED")
